# Atlas Core Component Token Specification & DTCG Manifest
**Author:** Onyx Van Dyk  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 17:10  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Component-level design token definitions for Atlas Core, mapping SaaS and Face-to-Face service components to semantic scales with strict governance documented from Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "_meta": {
    "module": "Atlas Core / Component Tier",
    "author": "Onyx Van Dyk",
    "role": "Design Agent (GPT-5.6)",
    "governance": {
      "source_document": "Company Document",
      "usage_rationale": "Utilized Company Document Section 3 (Hybrid Service Standards) to establish minimum 48px touch targets for Face-to-Face terminals and Section 5 (Accessibility & Contrast) to mandate AAA compliant state bindings across SaaS interactive components."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "action-button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.default}", "$type": "color" },
          "hover": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.hover}", "$type": "color" },
          "active": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.active}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "layout": {
          "min-height": { "$value": "{semantic.dimension.touch-target.kiosk}", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Enforces physical terminal compliance per Company Document spec." },
          "padding-inline": { "$value": "{semantic.spacing.inline.lg}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "border-radius": { "$value": "{semantic.shape.radius.interactive}", "$type": "dimension" }
        }
      }
    },
    "service-card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "$value": "{semantic.color.surface.elevated}", "$type": "color" },
        "border-width": { "$value": "1px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "border-color": { "$value": "{semantic.color.border.subtle}", "$type": "color" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{semantic.elevation.shadow.card}", "$type": "shadow" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```